WEBVTT

01:31.232 --> 01:33.851
[Episode 26]

01:45.120 --> 01:46.620
Le Yan.

01:50.159 --> 01:52.340
Master, I've finished.

01:56.480 --> 01:57.830
Excellent brushwork,

01:57.830 --> 01:59.220
but...

01:59.220 --> 02:00.739
It lacks a finishing touch.

02:18.560 --> 02:20.520
Belated Spring.

02:20.520 --> 02:22.639
At night, news of spring arrived.

02:22.639 --> 02:24.120
It got me in the mood.

02:24.120 --> 02:25.960
I secretly expressed my longing for love.

02:25.960 --> 02:28.000
Only spring knew about my love.

02:28.000 --> 02:29.659
This is Belated Spring.

02:30.400 --> 02:32.120
Since Ling Yi passed away,

02:32.120 --> 02:35.080
I've been feeling uneasy.

02:35.080 --> 02:36.400
The winter is long,

02:36.400 --> 02:38.760
and spring is far out of reach.

02:38.760 --> 02:41.780
But that day,
when I put down the dagger in front of you,

02:43.039 --> 02:44.780
I suddenly realized

02:47.280 --> 02:49.240
the dead are gone,

02:49.240 --> 02:52.340
but the living should live for themselves.

02:53.159 --> 02:56.900
Le Yan, you made me live again.

02:57.680 --> 03:01.340
In the future,
I want to live for myself once more.

03:03.120 --> 03:05.520
It's wonderful that you think this way.

03:05.520 --> 03:08.800
The other day, you were deeply sorrowful,

03:08.800 --> 03:11.240
yet you still managed to assist Director Meng
in fighting corruption.

03:11.240 --> 03:15.080
I admire you deeply,
and I also worry about you.

03:15.080 --> 03:18.659
So I painted this spring scene for you.

03:25.800 --> 03:29.479
Le Yan, all of this is because of you.

03:29.479 --> 03:33.219
Only by your side can I be my true self.

03:36.080 --> 03:38.180
A romantic relationship is forbidden
between teachers and students.

03:39.280 --> 03:41.500
It's going to be a tough road.

03:45.039 --> 03:47.319
But if I persevere,

03:47.319 --> 03:49.310
Le Yan,

03:49.310 --> 03:52.939
will you be brave for me, just this once?

04:02.640 --> 04:05.560
I did not understand what love was,

04:05.560 --> 04:08.200
but seeing my parents support

04:08.200 --> 04:09.639
and love each other,

04:09.639 --> 04:13.900
and seeing Zhi Shu risk everything
to find an antidote for Miss Yan,

04:15.000 --> 04:18.139
and seeing you in utter despair,

04:19.040 --> 04:21.120
I finally understood

04:21.120 --> 04:22.879
that love

04:22.879 --> 04:25.279
can make people risk their lives

04:25.279 --> 04:26.860
and feel heart-wrenching pain.

04:30.040 --> 04:32.959
I do not wish to be trapped by conventions,

04:32.959 --> 04:34.740
or bound by old rites.

04:37.600 --> 04:39.200
Previously,

04:40.060 --> 04:41.620
you had a family.

04:42.639 --> 04:44.220
I dared not overstep the bounds.

04:48.600 --> 04:50.110
But today,

04:50.820 --> 04:52.819
I want to boldly say one thing.

04:54.759 --> 04:56.259
I also

04:57.720 --> 04:59.740
have feelings for you.

05:05.240 --> 05:08.279
I've prepared this gift for a long time,

05:08.279 --> 05:10.100
and today, I can finally give it to you.

05:17.959 --> 05:19.959
It is a love lock.

05:19.959 --> 05:24.899
I personally drew the cloud pattern
on this lock.

05:25.959 --> 05:27.480
With my heart as the lock,

05:27.480 --> 05:29.319
and the gentle breeze as the key,

05:29.319 --> 05:32.839
this lock represents my love for you.

05:32.839 --> 05:34.339
I will never do you wrong.

06:02.000 --> 06:04.240
<i>I want to protect you forever.</i>

06:04.240 --> 06:05.740
<i>Will you be brave for me,</i>

06:06.890 --> 06:08.440
<i>just this once?</i>

06:25.718 --> 06:28.244
[Gu Mansion]

06:41.279 --> 06:42.480
Who are you?

06:42.480 --> 06:44.040
How dare you barge into my house!

06:44.040 --> 06:45.680
You have some nerve!

06:45.680 --> 06:48.240
I am certainly not as bold as you.

06:48.240 --> 06:50.480
You kept the Huxiao Gang as your pawns.

06:50.480 --> 06:52.199
And after using them up,

06:52.199 --> 06:55.819
you even cruelly sentenced your own brother
to death.

06:58.230 --> 07:01.160
You're just a masked coward.

07:01.160 --> 07:03.660
How dare you talk nonsense and threaten me!

07:05.920 --> 07:08.680
Every dirty deal between you and Ling Yun Fei

07:08.680 --> 07:10.899
is enough to warrant the extermination
of your entire clan.

07:15.040 --> 07:16.519
Who exactly are you?

07:16.519 --> 07:18.279
How do you know so much?

07:18.279 --> 07:20.120
Who I am is not important.

07:20.120 --> 07:22.800
What is important is that within three days,

07:22.800 --> 07:26.339
you must present the military deployment map
of Qingzhou to me.

07:27.079 --> 07:29.879
After all, you don't want Meng Ting Hui

07:29.879 --> 07:32.699
to get a copy of this ledger, do you?

07:37.639 --> 07:39.779
The military deployment map is confidential.

07:40.439 --> 07:42.399
If I steal the map for you,

07:42.399 --> 07:45.360
when it's exposed, I'll still be doomed.

07:45.360 --> 07:48.480
Do you think you can survive
by just taking no action?

07:48.480 --> 07:51.839
Meng Ting Hui will soon
trace everything back to you.

07:51.839 --> 07:54.980
Doing nothing means death.

07:56.600 --> 07:58.560
If you work with me,

07:58.560 --> 08:01.180
I can show you a way out.

08:02.990 --> 08:04.490
Like what?

08:07.160 --> 08:11.240
Help your prized student Shen Zhi Li
become empress.

08:11.240 --> 08:13.240
When this country changes hands,

08:13.240 --> 08:15.399
you will still be the head of all officials.

08:15.399 --> 08:16.879
If anything unexpected happens,

08:16.879 --> 08:19.740
she will be your best lifeline.

08:22.680 --> 08:24.690
Since we are to cooperate,

08:24.690 --> 08:26.420
we should be honest with each other.

08:27.800 --> 08:30.100
I also need to know your background.

08:43.840 --> 08:45.340
You are back.

08:48.679 --> 08:50.840
You went to see Lord Gu again.

08:50.840 --> 08:53.480
None of your business.

08:53.480 --> 08:54.840
You don't want

08:54.840 --> 08:56.899
to talk to me anymore?

08:58.900 --> 09:01.330
Since you learned what the peach wood means,

09:01.330 --> 09:03.200
you have been avoiding me.

09:03.200 --> 09:04.899
How long will you keep avoiding me?

09:08.840 --> 09:10.759
It's not that we can't talk.

09:10.759 --> 09:13.320
It's that there are some things
you shouldn't say.

09:13.320 --> 09:15.000
Nian, you are still young.

09:15.000 --> 09:17.240
My feelings have nothing to do with age.

09:17.240 --> 09:19.820
That year,
I was the only one left in my entire family.

09:20.460 --> 09:23.559
It was you who used a handkerchief
to bandage my injured hand.

09:23.559 --> 09:26.799
You told me that mastering martial arts
would be the best consolation for him.

09:26.799 --> 09:30.470
It was also you who took me
to get close to your parents and brother,

09:30.470 --> 09:32.720
and to spar with His Majesty and Huang Bo.

09:32.720 --> 09:35.180
You walked with me through the hardest days.

09:35.180 --> 09:37.170
From then on, I swore

09:37.170 --> 09:39.220
I would grow up quickly to protect you.

09:41.570 --> 09:44.850
Nian, you misunderstood.

09:44.850 --> 09:47.170
In my heart, you are my younger brother.

09:47.170 --> 09:49.200
I have never misunderstood.

09:49.200 --> 09:50.919
I know how I feel about you.

09:50.919 --> 09:53.980
Besides, you and I are not blood-related.

09:55.000 --> 09:58.679
Then you call my parents Mother and Father,
and call Zhi Shu brother.

09:58.679 --> 10:00.600
Isn't that a family tie?

10:00.600 --> 10:02.419
But wouldn't that be even better?

10:03.120 --> 10:05.080
If you and I are together someday,

10:05.080 --> 10:06.720
it will save me the trouble
of changing how I address them.

10:06.720 --> 10:09.000
Don't beat around the bush with me.

10:09.000 --> 10:11.559
I am a few years older than you,
so I am your elder sister.

10:11.559 --> 10:13.039
You are still young

10:13.039 --> 10:15.159
and cannot yet discern your true feelings.

10:15.159 --> 10:17.200
When you meet a better woman you like,

10:17.200 --> 10:19.259
you will know the difference
between family love and romantic love.

10:22.399 --> 10:24.960
There is no woman better than you.

10:24.960 --> 10:26.380
Zhi Li,

10:26.380 --> 10:29.019
I've long been clear
about how I feel about you.

10:30.399 --> 10:32.490
What about you, Zhi Li?

10:32.490 --> 10:34.779
Can you discern your feelings for him?

10:36.960 --> 10:39.100
I am clear about my own feelings.

10:39.759 --> 10:41.259
No need for others to comment.

10:43.639 --> 10:45.340
So in your heart,

10:46.159 --> 10:50.259
compared to Lord Gu,
I am already considered an outsider?

10:52.340 --> 10:56.360
I know that confessing my feelings to you
will create distance between us,

10:56.360 --> 10:58.320
but I don't regret it.

10:58.320 --> 11:00.200
I don't care
how long it takes for you to love me.

11:00.200 --> 11:02.240
Even if it takes a lifetime,

11:02.240 --> 11:03.779
I will gladly wait.

11:05.080 --> 11:07.120
Calm down.

11:07.120 --> 11:09.120
Don't act on impulse.

11:09.120 --> 11:11.860
I have placed the peach wood in your room.

11:14.559 --> 11:16.080
I have already made myself very clear.

11:16.080 --> 11:17.580
Don't...

11:18.600 --> 11:21.000
You love to read ancient law books.

11:21.000 --> 11:24.080
Every time you go out,
you always bring many bamboo slips.

11:24.080 --> 11:25.759
I thought it was inconvenient
to search through them,

11:25.759 --> 11:29.879
so I copied the content you frequently check
into this book.

11:29.879 --> 11:31.519
I deliberately wrote in large characters,

11:31.519 --> 11:34.580
so you won't strain your eyes
when reading at night.

11:36.840 --> 11:38.559
You don't need to feel troubled.

11:38.559 --> 11:40.960
I didn't do this to make you love me.

11:40.960 --> 11:42.759
I hope

11:42.759 --> 11:46.419
that you will be with the one you truly love.

12:08.360 --> 12:09.960
Grain and fodder are the lifeblood
of the army.

12:09.960 --> 12:12.150
Due to your negligence,
the army provisions were looted.

12:12.150 --> 12:15.040
- Execute him without pardon!
- General Huo, Mr. Shen.

12:15.040 --> 12:16.470
Have mercy on me, please!

12:16.470 --> 12:18.639
Mr. Shen, it was under Pang Mu's watch

12:18.639 --> 12:20.480
that the 30,000 dan of grain were lost,

12:20.480 --> 12:22.730
but the bandits were well-trained
and came with great force.

12:22.730 --> 12:25.000
- It's not a capital offense.
- Isn't it?

12:25.000 --> 12:26.840
Beijian's cavalry
is less than 100 li away from here.

12:26.840 --> 12:28.120
If they take this chance to attack now,

12:28.120 --> 12:31.000
we might lose Qingzhou
due to a lack of provisions.

12:31.000 --> 12:32.279
Before His Majesty punishes you,

12:32.279 --> 12:33.879
you should all atone for the crime
by killing yourselves.

12:33.879 --> 12:35.379
Take him away.

12:36.879 --> 12:38.120
General Huo.

12:38.120 --> 12:39.159
General Huo!

12:39.159 --> 12:40.600
Mr. Shen!

12:40.600 --> 12:41.639
Mr. Shen.

12:41.639 --> 12:43.320
The urgent matter is to gather grain.

12:43.320 --> 12:44.860
I have sent an urgent report to the court,

12:44.860 --> 12:46.200
but the allocation process is cumbersome.

12:46.200 --> 12:48.240
And we're pressed for time.

12:48.240 --> 12:50.360
The grain gathered
from official granaries in Qingzhou

12:50.360 --> 12:52.379
can only last for seven days.

12:53.919 --> 12:56.039
Tell the soldiers to hold on for seven days.

12:56.039 --> 12:59.179
I will find a way to get 30,000 dan of grain.

13:03.510 --> 13:05.570
Your Majesty.

13:05.570 --> 13:08.379
Your Majesty, I got a letter from Zhi Shu.

13:12.540 --> 13:15.220
<i>Your Majesty,
I've infiltrated the Blood Moon Society.</i>

13:15.220 --> 13:17.960
<i>Upon investigation,
their leader is called Mr. Shangguan.</i>

13:17.960 --> 13:19.519
<i>He is most likely hiding in the capital.</i>

13:19.519 --> 13:21.480
<i>The remnants of Zhongwan are based
in Qingzhou</i>

13:21.480 --> 13:22.639
<i>and are conspiring with Beijian.</i>

13:22.639 --> 13:25.240
<i>They intend to provoke a border conflict
while we lost our army provisions.</i>

13:25.240 --> 13:26.639
<i>I've planted secret agents,</i>

13:26.639 --> 13:28.000
<i>but the military situation is urgent.</i>

13:28.000 --> 13:30.000
<i>I hope
Your Majesty will make early preparations.</i>

13:30.000 --> 13:32.700
Beijian has long
coveted the iron mines of Qingzhou.

13:32.700 --> 13:34.860
If the remnants of Zhongwan use this as bait,

13:34.860 --> 13:37.840
Beijian might treacherously break the treaty.

13:37.840 --> 13:39.960
If Zhongwan and Beijian join forces,

13:39.960 --> 13:42.960
I fear war will break out on the border.

13:42.960 --> 13:44.120
Go pass down the order.

13:44.120 --> 13:45.919
Have the Ministry of War
allocate grain to Qingzhou,

13:45.919 --> 13:48.480
and have the elite troops of Shazhou
provide covert support.

13:48.480 --> 13:52.600
Tell Zhi Shu to sabotage the cooperation
between Zhongwan and Beijian,

13:52.600 --> 13:56.470
but remind him
that his own safety must be the top priority.

13:56.470 --> 13:57.980
Yes, Your Majesty.

14:06.592 --> 14:08.275
[Yan Residence]

14:10.800 --> 14:11.960
Don't worry, Mr. Chen.

14:11.960 --> 14:14.480
The contract will be delivered
to Qingzhou within three days.

14:14.480 --> 14:17.600
The Bofeng House branch will
follow the 70-30 profit split as we agreed.

14:17.600 --> 14:19.240
Ms. Yan, you're quite straightforward.

14:19.240 --> 14:21.340
We'll await the contract.

14:34.600 --> 14:37.200
Father, it's windy outside.

14:37.200 --> 14:39.240
Why did you come out?

14:39.240 --> 14:42.750
Back then, when you insisted on going
to the capital with Meng Ting Hui,

14:42.750 --> 14:45.399
I was so angry and smashed three tea sets.

14:45.399 --> 14:46.679
But now it seems

14:46.679 --> 14:50.440
you have indeed seen a larger world with her.

14:50.440 --> 14:54.240
Seeing how you negotiate
with chambers of commerce,

14:54.240 --> 14:57.620
even an old merchant like me
has to admire you.

14:59.679 --> 15:01.179
My daughter,

15:03.840 --> 15:05.580
you have grown up.

15:09.080 --> 15:10.580
Father,

15:11.399 --> 15:15.120
you always opposed me appearing in public

15:15.120 --> 15:17.080
and doing business.

15:17.080 --> 15:19.940
This is the first time
you've praised Meng and me.

15:21.519 --> 15:23.680
Since Ding Chong fell from power,

15:23.680 --> 15:27.840
I've seen the number of merchant caravans
in Shazhou increase by 70 percent.

15:27.840 --> 15:30.559
Not only have our businesses improved,

15:30.559 --> 15:34.559
but even poor families
can now afford to eat meat.

15:34.559 --> 15:40.019
You've gradually changed my mind.

15:44.200 --> 15:47.259
Sweetie, don't try.

15:48.620 --> 15:52.080
You are now the head of our family.

15:52.080 --> 15:55.139
You can't just cry like this.

16:00.448 --> 16:01.972
[Yan Residence]

16:03.360 --> 16:04.759
Fu Zhi.

16:04.759 --> 16:06.259
Zhi Shu.

16:06.900 --> 16:08.820
Master Yan, I'm here to see--

16:11.000 --> 16:12.500
Father-in-law.

16:13.500 --> 16:16.080
Did you really think I was senile?

16:16.080 --> 16:19.240
Stop pretending

16:19.240 --> 16:21.419
to be a couple.

16:24.360 --> 16:27.399
Father, I had no choice.

16:27.399 --> 16:29.490
It was you who deceived me first.

16:29.490 --> 16:31.500
I didn't mean to deceive you.

16:32.559 --> 16:34.960
Master Yan, this is not Fu Zhi's fault.

16:34.960 --> 16:37.600
It was I who said those words.

16:37.600 --> 16:39.620
I'm to blame.

16:41.320 --> 16:42.679
Forget it.

16:42.679 --> 16:44.600
I've come around now.

16:44.600 --> 16:46.279
I won't force you to marry.

16:46.279 --> 16:48.799
You don't need to pretend anymore.

16:48.799 --> 16:52.080
Fu Zhi, you are a lady after all,

16:52.080 --> 16:54.600
and you can't risk your reputation.

16:54.600 --> 16:56.720
You can handle things on your own,

16:56.720 --> 16:59.240
but no matter how much you earn,

16:59.240 --> 17:00.850
I still hope

17:00.850 --> 17:04.899
you will have a good man to love you.

17:07.920 --> 17:11.670
Master Yan,
Fu Zhi and I never pretend to love.

17:11.670 --> 17:15.579
Fu Zhi and I love each other,
and I will be faithful to her.

17:16.599 --> 17:19.920
I am very glad to hear that.

17:19.920 --> 17:21.950
You are a guest,

17:21.950 --> 17:25.200
so I'll prepare a big dinner to welcome you.

17:25.200 --> 17:26.599
The military situation is urgent.

17:26.599 --> 17:29.400
I'm here to seek help from Fu Zhi.

17:29.400 --> 17:31.539
Just tell me what I can do for you.

17:33.720 --> 17:36.870
Fu Zhi, this matter is of great importance.

17:36.870 --> 17:39.079
Qingzhou urgently needs 30,000 dan of grain.

17:39.079 --> 17:41.480
It must be delivered within seven days.

17:41.480 --> 17:43.440
The court can allocate grain,

17:43.440 --> 17:45.440
but we're pressed for time.

17:45.440 --> 17:47.799
Although I have restaurants,

17:47.799 --> 17:50.559
to gather 30,000 dan of grain
within seven days,

17:50.559 --> 17:52.059
I'm afraid...

17:53.170 --> 17:55.640
Father, I don't have many connections here.

17:55.640 --> 17:57.920
Could you help us and act as a guarantor

17:57.920 --> 18:00.240
to purchase private grain
from close merchants?

18:00.240 --> 18:03.339
- Even at a high price--
- Master, you can't do that.

18:04.640 --> 18:08.299
30,000 dan of grain will cost all our money.

18:09.640 --> 18:11.279
Although you're from a noble family,

18:11.279 --> 18:12.799
your annual salary is only 100 taels.

18:12.799 --> 18:14.599
Before your betrothal gifts have arrived,

18:14.599 --> 18:16.720
you expect us to financially help you?

18:16.720 --> 18:18.279
Master Yan, if you're willing to help,

18:18.279 --> 18:19.680
I can write a proof of debt right now,

18:19.680 --> 18:20.960
and I'll definitely pay you back.

18:20.960 --> 18:22.460
Master.

18:23.079 --> 18:24.720
Officials are not trustworthy.

18:24.720 --> 18:27.579
We used to lend money to people,
but they never paid back.

18:29.960 --> 18:32.079
Did you take a liking to Fu Zhi,

18:32.079 --> 18:34.359
or did you take a liking to our wealth?

18:34.359 --> 18:36.200
You are obsessed with money yourself,

18:36.200 --> 18:38.200
but not everyone is.

18:38.200 --> 18:42.319
Master, I'm just thinking about our family.

18:42.319 --> 18:45.799
After all, that's our hard-earned money.

18:45.799 --> 18:47.779
How can we throw it around like this?

18:50.039 --> 18:52.720
Mr. Shen, do you urgently need grain

18:52.720 --> 18:55.940
because of Beijian?

18:57.220 --> 19:00.119
Master Yan, to be honest,

19:00.119 --> 19:01.880
the situation is still unclear.

19:01.880 --> 19:05.019
Although war hasn't broken out yet,
we must not drop our guard.

19:16.119 --> 19:20.160
Since you're personally seeking help,
it must be extremely urgent.

19:20.160 --> 19:22.200
It is also a sign of trust in our family.

19:22.200 --> 19:24.520
Though I'm just a merchant,

19:24.520 --> 19:27.559
I know national security is above all.

19:27.559 --> 19:30.680
Fu Zhi, here is my seal.

19:30.680 --> 19:33.839
You have full authority
to dispatch grain from our granaries.

19:33.839 --> 19:34.839
If it's not enough,

19:34.839 --> 19:38.920
from today, all our shops
will only purchase grain and not sell goods.

19:38.920 --> 19:42.339
We will also purchase private grain
from other major shops.

19:44.039 --> 19:45.200
Thank you, Master Yan.

19:45.200 --> 19:47.030
I will write the proof now.

19:47.030 --> 19:51.119
Mr. Shen, are you treating me
like a profit-driven merchant?

19:51.119 --> 19:54.799
Master, you don't think about yourself,

19:54.799 --> 19:56.920
but think about Song.

19:56.920 --> 20:01.240
If war really breaks out,
30,000 dan of grain won't be enough.

20:01.240 --> 20:04.759
A proof will mean nothing then.

20:04.759 --> 20:07.920
Merchants can only make money
in times of peace.

20:07.920 --> 20:09.720
We can enjoy our wealth and safety

20:09.720 --> 20:12.200
only when soldiers protect our country.

20:12.200 --> 20:17.119
You short-sighted woman, stay out of this.

20:17.119 --> 20:18.839
Master!

20:18.839 --> 20:20.740
Help her back to her room.

20:21.599 --> 20:23.220
Madam, get up.

20:27.559 --> 20:29.059
Madam.

20:34.039 --> 20:35.660
Thank you, Father.

20:36.920 --> 20:38.920
I'd like to thank Fu Zhi and Master Yan

20:38.920 --> 20:40.359
on behalf of our soldiers.

20:40.359 --> 20:42.960
No need to thank me, both of you.

20:42.960 --> 20:45.140
Come on, get up.

20:48.440 --> 20:49.440
Fu Zhi.

20:49.440 --> 20:51.960
I will arrange for the wagons
to transport grain right away.

20:51.960 --> 20:54.400
I have other urgent things to do,
so I cannot stay with you.

20:54.400 --> 20:55.599
Go ahead and do your things.

20:55.599 --> 20:58.220
I will handle the grain matter properly.

21:01.240 --> 21:02.780
Shen Zhi Shu!

21:14.400 --> 21:15.900
Speak.

21:18.039 --> 21:19.759
Shen Zhi Shu, listen carefully.

21:19.759 --> 21:22.000
I am famously known in Shazhou
for loving handsome men.

21:22.000 --> 21:24.160
If you come back with even one more scar,

21:24.160 --> 21:25.820
I will dump you,

21:25.820 --> 21:28.279
and then find ten men more handsome than you.

21:28.279 --> 21:29.779
That won't do.

21:31.119 --> 21:32.279
I have three scars here,

21:32.279 --> 21:33.680
left from when my father disciplined me.

21:33.680 --> 21:35.279
You must have a look

21:35.279 --> 21:38.430
in case you dump me because of old scars.

21:38.430 --> 21:41.220
- Here, look.
- Shen Zhi Shu!

21:45.240 --> 21:46.770
Alright.

21:47.450 --> 21:49.010
I was just kidding.

21:55.079 --> 21:58.680
What I mean is,
I want you to come back safe and sound.

21:58.680 --> 22:00.539
Not even a hair of your head will be harmed.

22:02.480 --> 22:03.980
Do you hear me?

22:15.960 --> 22:17.460
Wait for me.

22:27.000 --> 22:28.500
I'll wait for you.

22:39.680 --> 22:40.759
Your Majesty,

22:40.759 --> 22:43.279
Beijian has submitted a diplomatic letter
for the third time

22:43.279 --> 22:45.359
about the marriage alliance.

22:45.359 --> 22:49.599
I've discussed with the court officials,

22:49.599 --> 22:52.480
and we believe
Grand Tutor Shen's daughter, Shen Zhi Li,

22:52.480 --> 22:55.240
is virtuous, talented, and dignified

22:55.240 --> 22:58.160
and can serve as a model for all women.

22:58.160 --> 23:03.559
I humbly request Your Majesty
to name her empress.

23:03.559 --> 23:05.859
I second the proposal.

23:08.359 --> 23:09.359
Your Majesty.

23:09.359 --> 23:10.559
I previously thought

23:10.559 --> 23:13.359
that marrying Beijian's goddess
could consolidate the border,

23:13.359 --> 23:16.039
but seeing Lord Xu's fervent desire for war,

23:16.039 --> 23:17.440
I thought twice

23:17.440 --> 23:20.240
and realized that Lord Xu indeed made sense.

23:20.240 --> 23:21.440
The Shen family holds a noble status.

23:21.440 --> 23:22.920
They're known for their scholarly traditions,

23:22.920 --> 23:24.599
unmatched in nobility.

23:24.599 --> 23:26.720
Shen Zhi Li is indeed the perfect candidate
for empress.

23:26.720 --> 23:29.180
I second the proposal.

23:32.119 --> 23:35.400
You two are
actually sharing the same thought today.

23:35.400 --> 23:37.440
Your Majesty,

23:37.440 --> 23:40.720
previously,
Lord Gu and I indeed had disagreements,

23:40.720 --> 23:42.599
but today, we happen to have the same view.

23:42.599 --> 23:44.339
It precisely shows

23:44.339 --> 23:48.880
Shen Zhi Li is the choice everyone expects.

23:48.880 --> 23:50.980
Lord Xu is absolutely right.

23:52.759 --> 23:55.559
I implore Your Majesty to have an empress

23:55.559 --> 23:57.839
to stabilize the nation
and continue the royal lineage.

23:57.839 --> 24:01.640
You are quite thoughtful.

24:01.640 --> 24:04.200
But I've always respected the Shen family.

24:04.200 --> 24:07.079
You're jointly recommending Shen Zhi Li
as empress.

24:07.079 --> 24:10.160
Shouldn't you first ask Grand Tutor Shen
for his opinion?

24:10.160 --> 24:14.480
I feared Your Majesty might have concerns,

24:14.480 --> 24:18.579
so I've already requested Grand Tutor Shen
to co-sign the petition.

24:21.728 --> 24:23.079
[Shen Wu Chen]

24:23.079 --> 24:27.640
Your Majesty, the joint petition
has been presented before you.

24:27.640 --> 24:32.480
I'll have the Ministry of Rites
prepare for the Announcement Ceremony,

24:32.480 --> 24:35.599
and the Imperial Observatory
select an auspicious date for the wedding.

24:35.599 --> 24:38.279
I request Your Majesty
to draft the decree soon

24:38.279 --> 24:42.059
to announce the chosen empress to the world.

24:44.240 --> 24:46.839
I second the proposal.

24:46.839 --> 24:49.359
I second the proposal.

24:49.359 --> 24:52.059
I second the proposal.

25:00.720 --> 25:03.160
[Conferring Shen Zhi Li as Empress]
No matter what happened,

25:03.160 --> 25:06.240
you were always on my side.

25:06.240 --> 25:07.440
But now?

25:07.440 --> 25:11.799
I do this to cut off Beijian's wild fancy

25:11.799 --> 25:16.279
and your inappropriate feelings
for Meng Ting Hui.

25:16.279 --> 25:19.599
Your Majesty,
you can hide it from anyone but me.

25:19.599 --> 25:21.559
When you rewarded Meng Ting Hui in the past,

25:21.559 --> 25:23.039
I did not say a word,

25:23.039 --> 25:25.519
because I trusted your judgment
in appointing people.

25:25.519 --> 25:28.680
However, Meng Ting Hui's identity
as the princess of Zhongwan

25:28.680 --> 25:31.359
determines that she is not destined for you.

25:31.359 --> 25:32.400
After much deliberation,

25:32.400 --> 25:36.839
only in this way can Your Majesty
distance yourself from Meng Ting Hui.

25:36.839 --> 25:41.000
But Meng Ting Hui knows nothing
about her origins.

25:41.000 --> 25:43.480
Even if the remnants of Zhongwan
have designs on her,

25:43.480 --> 25:44.839
I will personally resolve it

25:44.839 --> 25:47.400
and absolutely not get her involved.

25:47.400 --> 25:49.799
Why is her real identity such a big deal?

25:49.799 --> 25:53.319
We're sure the remnants of Zhongwan plot
to restore their country.

25:53.319 --> 25:55.400
If she one day learns of the past,

25:55.400 --> 25:57.559
in the face of national hatred,

25:57.559 --> 25:59.680
who can predict her choice?

25:59.680 --> 26:01.079
For the stability of our country,

26:01.079 --> 26:03.940
I dare not take any chances.

26:05.200 --> 26:09.319
The late emperor gave me the Mandate Token,

26:09.319 --> 26:11.799
granting me the power of life and death,

26:11.799 --> 26:14.440
and bestowing supreme honor upon my family.

26:14.440 --> 26:16.200
Today,

26:16.200 --> 26:18.799
I'm going to use this token
to implore Your Majesty

26:18.799 --> 26:21.119
to accept the recommendation
of the two chancellors and the ministers

26:21.119 --> 26:24.980
- and establish Zhi Li as empress.
- Grand Tutor Shen!

26:27.599 --> 26:30.119
You're forcing me too?

26:30.119 --> 26:33.480
The ministers jointly recommended Zhi Li,
all with their own agendas.

26:33.480 --> 26:35.079
But I make a promise here.

26:35.079 --> 26:37.640
My family only prioritizes Your Majesty
and the Ning Empire,

26:37.640 --> 26:39.960
and will absolutely not be swayed
by any faction.

26:39.960 --> 26:41.720
After much deliberation,

26:41.720 --> 26:46.700
I think
Zhi Li is the best candidate for empress.

26:47.759 --> 26:49.519
To avoid any suspicion,

26:49.519 --> 26:52.299
once the wedding ceremony concludes,

26:53.039 --> 26:57.000
I'll move away from the capital with my wife,

26:57.000 --> 26:59.599
retiring completely.

26:59.599 --> 27:02.019
Your Majesty,
Director Meng requests an audience.

27:05.000 --> 27:10.200
I implore Your Majesty to decide soon

27:10.200 --> 27:13.259
to stabilize the overall situation.

27:32.359 --> 27:33.440
[Conferring Shen Zhi Li as Empress]
<i>Your Majesty,</i>

27:33.440 --> 27:34.599
<i>Xu Ting, the Left Chancellor,</i>

27:34.599 --> 27:36.079
<i>Gu Qin, the Right Chancellor,</i>

27:36.079 --> 27:37.920
<i>along with the six ministries
and nine chief ministers,</i>

27:37.920 --> 27:39.880
<i>a total of 236 court officials,</i>

27:39.880 --> 27:43.579
<i>have jointly petitioned
to recommend Zhi Li as empress.</i>

27:44.440 --> 27:48.359
<i>Grand Tutor Shen even
used the Mandate Token from the late emperor,</i>

27:48.359 --> 27:50.960
<i>requesting Your Majesty
to hold the Announcement Ceremony</i>

27:50.960 --> 27:52.839
<i>at the Sacred Ancestral Hall in seven days,</i>

27:52.839 --> 27:56.279
<i>draft the empress appointment decree,
and announce it to the nation</i>

27:56.279 --> 28:00.019
<i>for the national stability and people.</i>

28:01.759 --> 28:03.440
<i>Fu Zhi,</i>

28:03.440 --> 28:05.400
<i>when you returned from Shazhou last time,</i>

28:05.400 --> 28:07.819
<i>you asked if I had feelings for His Majesty.</i>

28:08.480 --> 28:10.519
<i>At that time, I was not sure</i>

28:10.519 --> 28:12.559
<i>and hastily denied it.</i>

28:12.559 --> 28:14.680
<i>But after several brushes with death,</i>

28:14.680 --> 28:17.640
<i>His Majesty and I
have confessed our feelings to each other.</i>

28:17.640 --> 28:20.279
<i>Because of ancestral rules,</i>

28:20.279 --> 28:22.039
<i>we can't make our love public.</i>

28:22.039 --> 28:24.299
<i>Yet we have burning love for each other.</i>

28:24.920 --> 28:26.519
<i>But right now,</i>

28:26.519 --> 28:30.200
<i>the entire court
jointly recommended Zhi Li as empress.</i>

28:30.200 --> 28:31.839
<i>She is not only my colleague,</i>

28:31.839 --> 28:34.960
<i>but also my close friend
who has faced life and death with me.</i>

28:34.960 --> 28:37.279
<i>Facing the overt and covert attacks
in the court,</i>

28:37.279 --> 28:39.440
<i>I have never been afraid.</i>

28:39.440 --> 28:41.680
<i>But the current situation</i>

28:41.680 --> 28:44.460
<i>has made me feel melancholy
for the first time.</i>

28:45.160 --> 28:47.090
<i>I truly have no one else to confide in</i>

28:47.090 --> 28:51.140
<i>about my complicated feelings but you.</i>

29:13.200 --> 29:15.839
<i>I hope you can join hands with me</i>

29:15.839 --> 29:18.039
<i>to recommend Shen Zhi Li as empress.</i>

29:18.039 --> 29:21.620
Everyone knows
Shen Zhi Li is your prized student.

29:21.620 --> 29:24.140
Why should I help you consolidate your power?

29:24.140 --> 29:27.240
Now, Meng Ting Hui's power is growing,

29:27.240 --> 29:29.279
and her supporters are increasing day by day.

29:29.279 --> 29:30.880
She is also on good terms
with the Shen family.

29:30.880 --> 29:32.450
She

29:32.450 --> 29:34.680
is the greatest threat to us.

29:34.680 --> 29:38.039
If Grand Tutor Shen rallies the officials
to recommend Meng Ting Hui,

29:38.039 --> 29:40.539
and then His Majesty says yes,

29:41.279 --> 29:43.110
well,

29:43.110 --> 29:45.720
neither of us can stop it.

29:45.720 --> 29:48.160
<i>If we recommend Shen Zhi Li as empress,</i>

29:48.160 --> 29:51.079
<i>it can completely dash Meng Ting Hui's hopes
for becoming empress,</i>

29:51.079 --> 29:53.359
<i>and also drive a wedge
between her and the Shen family.</i>

29:53.359 --> 29:56.519
<i>The Censorate will inevitably be affected.</i>

29:56.519 --> 30:01.160
This is entirely beneficial to both of us.

30:01.160 --> 30:04.380
Your concern is
that Shen Zhi Li is my student.

30:06.160 --> 30:07.920
But Grand Tutor Shen
is the head of the Shen family,

30:07.920 --> 30:11.200
and Shen Zhi Shu and Di Nian
are both His Majesty's confidants.

30:11.200 --> 30:12.700
Which one

30:13.490 --> 30:16.039
do you think I can easily manipulate?

30:16.039 --> 30:18.079
The situation is now clear.

30:18.079 --> 30:19.740
Either Meng Ting Hui

30:20.359 --> 30:23.720
or Shen Zhi Li is to be the empress.

30:23.720 --> 30:25.500
I believe

30:26.200 --> 30:30.220
you have your own judgment
on the right choice.

31:00.640 --> 31:02.140
Le Yan.

31:12.519 --> 31:14.019
Zhi Li.

31:17.088 --> 31:19.124
[Gu Mansion]

31:22.370 --> 31:24.859
My name is indeed on the petition.

31:26.440 --> 31:28.160
I have nothing to say.

31:28.160 --> 31:32.839
We used to spend a happy time.

31:32.839 --> 31:36.859
We honestly shared intimate words.

31:37.839 --> 31:41.440
Is that all fake? Have you been pretending?

31:41.440 --> 31:44.220
My feelings for you are absolutely true.

31:46.160 --> 31:49.519
But Lord Xu and your father
jointly recommended you as empress.

31:49.519 --> 31:51.240
It's already inevitable.

31:51.240 --> 31:53.779
I had no choice but to make this decision.

31:55.000 --> 31:56.839
All of you had no choice.

31:56.839 --> 32:00.619
Even my open-minded parents have changed,

32:02.119 --> 32:06.380
either avoiding me or remaining silent.

32:07.640 --> 32:10.319
You all say you love me,

32:10.319 --> 32:12.200
but in your eyes,

32:12.200 --> 32:15.680
I am nothing but a puppet
you can manipulate at will.

32:15.680 --> 32:17.480
So, in your hearts,

32:17.480 --> 32:19.280
what I think

32:19.280 --> 32:22.220
doesn't matter at all?

32:25.079 --> 32:26.579
Le Yan,

32:27.519 --> 32:29.339
I am full of regret.

32:35.039 --> 32:36.680
How about I go to the palace immediately

32:36.680 --> 32:39.400
and honestly confess to His Majesty?

32:39.400 --> 32:41.039
Even if His Majesty is furious,

32:41.039 --> 32:43.440
I will bear all the consequences alone.

32:43.440 --> 32:45.410
No matter what happens,

32:45.410 --> 32:47.619
I will not let you be implicated.

32:48.559 --> 32:50.059
Master.

32:53.640 --> 32:55.559
Master.

32:55.559 --> 32:57.519
You are drunk.

32:57.519 --> 33:02.160
Our love will never be accepted
by the public.

33:02.160 --> 33:04.220
If it gets exposed,

33:05.559 --> 33:07.220
not only you and I,

33:08.319 --> 33:11.660
but even my parents and the entire Shen clan

33:12.559 --> 33:15.099
would face controversy and condemnation.

33:21.039 --> 33:23.619
Le Yan, if you want,

33:25.480 --> 33:27.420
I will take you away right now.

33:29.160 --> 33:31.519
I don't care about official career
or reputation.

33:31.519 --> 33:33.440
I can give it all up.

33:33.440 --> 33:35.039
Even if I am demoted to a commoner,

33:35.039 --> 33:37.079
even if I live a simple, ordinary life,

33:37.079 --> 33:38.680
as long as you are with me,

33:38.680 --> 33:41.400
the wilderness will be paradise,

33:41.400 --> 33:44.759
and a thatched hut will be our haven.

33:44.759 --> 33:46.259
Le Yan,

33:47.000 --> 33:48.500
trust me.

35:06.039 --> 35:08.760
Zhi Li, you finally came.

35:08.760 --> 35:10.340
I have something to tell you.

35:11.079 --> 35:14.320
Recently, Yin Qing and I have been
investigating the person behind Ling Yun Fei.

35:14.320 --> 35:18.280
- We didn't mean to hide it from you, but--
- Director Meng.

35:18.280 --> 35:19.880
It doesn't matter anymore.

35:19.880 --> 35:21.540
[Resignation]
I have already submitted this

35:21.540 --> 35:23.679
to the Ministry of Personnel,

35:23.679 --> 35:26.000
and this one is for you.

35:26.000 --> 35:27.579
Starting today,

35:28.890 --> 35:31.168
we can no longer work together
at the Censorate.

35:31.168 --> 35:35.960
[Resignation]

35:35.960 --> 35:38.079
You worked so hard to become a court official

35:38.079 --> 35:40.790
and made great contributions here.

35:40.790 --> 35:43.139
Are you really going to give up?

35:45.639 --> 35:47.559
We are women, after all.

35:47.559 --> 35:51.800
Meng,
I'm not afraid of losing this official job.

35:51.800 --> 35:57.199
I'm only afraid of not being able to be
with the one I love.

35:57.199 --> 35:58.920
I don't understand.

35:58.920 --> 36:02.159
Why can't the world accept us?

36:02.159 --> 36:05.260
You mean Lord Gu?

36:06.400 --> 36:08.219
He and I are in love.

36:08.920 --> 36:11.480
This is the first time I've loved someone.

36:11.480 --> 36:15.519
No matter what it takes,
I don't want to give up.

36:15.519 --> 36:18.400
I was just going to tell you
something about him.

36:18.400 --> 36:20.239
Zhi Li.

36:20.239 --> 36:21.559
Captain Di,

36:21.559 --> 36:23.920
tell Zhi Li what you know.

36:23.920 --> 36:26.080
He has been deceiving you all along.

36:26.080 --> 36:28.800
People believe
Lady Yuan died protecting Lord Gu,

36:28.800 --> 36:30.800
killed by bandits.

36:30.800 --> 36:34.239
But she actually died
at the hands of Lord Gu.

36:34.239 --> 36:37.720
Nian, you are talking nonsense.

36:37.720 --> 36:40.239
I saw how sad he was
when he lost his wife and child.

36:40.239 --> 36:41.559
Zhi Li,

36:41.559 --> 36:44.199
he did it all to make you empress.

36:44.199 --> 36:46.119
If you become empress,

36:46.119 --> 36:48.039
only he will benefit from it.

36:48.039 --> 36:51.000
Impossible.
He is absolutely not that kind of person.

36:51.000 --> 36:52.400
Zhi Li,

36:52.400 --> 36:55.010
Gu Qin is not worthy of you.

36:55.010 --> 36:57.920
Zhi Li, we've been collecting evidence
of his crimes recently.

36:57.920 --> 36:59.400
We're telling you in advance

36:59.400 --> 37:01.719
because we don't want you
to hear it from someone else,

37:01.719 --> 37:03.440
and even more,
we don't want to see you heartbroken.

37:03.440 --> 37:05.280
I know it's hard for you to accept right now,

37:05.280 --> 37:06.719
but this is the truth.

37:06.719 --> 37:09.420
There is a person who can prove it.

37:45.519 --> 37:47.780
Here is the military deployment map
you wanted.

37:47.780 --> 37:49.340
Mr. Shangguan.

37:50.679 --> 37:53.120
You're indeed well-informed.

37:53.120 --> 37:56.380
You actually found out about my identity
in just a few days.

37:57.880 --> 38:00.840
You used the Eternity Pill
to set up Ling Yun Fei.

38:00.840 --> 38:05.440
How long do you think you can hide?

38:05.440 --> 38:10.380
Who really caused his death, you or me?

38:13.800 --> 38:17.659
Enough talking. Where is the thing I want?

38:25.248 --> 38:28.212
[Ledger]

38:30.624 --> 38:32.215
[Qingzhou Military Deployment Map]

39:48.720 --> 39:51.460
It is time to show your true face.

40:08.910 --> 40:10.760
Just as Your Majesty guessed,

40:10.760 --> 40:13.380
they indeed
want the Qingzhou military deployment map.

40:19.808 --> 40:20.840
[Shen Mansion]

40:20.840 --> 40:23.519
The position of empress concerns the state.

40:23.519 --> 40:26.079
With the two chancellors vying for power,

40:26.079 --> 40:27.450
and Beijian coveting our country,

40:27.450 --> 40:30.320
we need a suitable empress,

40:30.320 --> 40:32.239
and you are the perfect person.

40:32.239 --> 40:34.880
In seven days, you'll be made empress
at the Announcement Ceremony.

40:34.880 --> 40:36.840
This is no longer a family matter,
but a state affair.

40:36.840 --> 40:38.159
It is already a sure thing.

40:38.159 --> 40:41.199
Father, it's strictly professional
between His Majesty and me.

40:41.199 --> 40:43.239
I cannot be his empress.

40:43.239 --> 40:46.079
And I'm already in love with someone else.

40:46.079 --> 40:47.619
I'm sorry?

40:50.159 --> 40:53.000
My teacher and I are in love with each other.

40:53.000 --> 40:56.719
Do you want me to marry His Majesty
while I love someone else?

40:56.719 --> 40:58.079
I cannot do it.

40:58.079 --> 41:00.480
It's a crime of deceiving the emperor.

41:00.480 --> 41:03.840
And for me, it's a heart-wrenching pain.

41:03.840 --> 41:05.579
I dare you to say it again.

41:06.760 --> 41:09.239
Father, even if I say it a million times,

41:09.239 --> 41:11.119
I want to be with my teacher.

41:11.119 --> 41:12.559
We truly love each other.

41:12.559 --> 41:15.239
Our family has been upright for generations.

41:15.239 --> 41:16.880
You read poetry and books
and learned etiquette,

41:16.880 --> 41:20.280
not to use them to defy human ethics.

41:20.280 --> 41:23.760
If your dear teacher truly liked you,

41:23.760 --> 41:27.519
how could he
personally recommend you as empress?

41:27.519 --> 41:29.440
He must have his reasons.

41:29.440 --> 41:33.239
He promised
that even if he faces public criticism,

41:33.239 --> 41:36.239
- he will still grow old with me.
- Wake up!

41:36.239 --> 41:37.280
Master!

41:37.280 --> 41:38.780
Zhi Li.

41:43.239 --> 41:44.780
This is the first time

41:46.480 --> 41:50.179
you have ever slapped me.
